*squints at the photograph, holding it to catch the light* 

Well I'll be damned... That's Joric and his old lab partner, back when they were still trying to save the world. Haven't seen Silas in years. Last I heard, he was holed up somewhere south, half-mad from the nanite sickness. Joric's doing better for himself these days.


{"give": [], "take": []}

*nods grimly*

Ran supplies to their research station back in the day. Project Purity, they called it. Joric's got Oasis now, but Silas... poor bastard's been fighting that nanite infection for years. Used to be brilliant, now he's just trying to stay sane.


